msgid "Learn about the authorization roles and permissions available for the IBM Quantum REST APIs."
msgstr "Ketahui tentang peranan kebenaran dan kebenaran akses yang tersedia untuk IBM Quantum REST API."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles"
msgstr "Peranan kebenaran"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles {#authorization-roles}"
msgstr "Peranan kebenaran {#authorization-roles}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review the available roles and the actions mapped to each to help you assign access. See [IAM roles and actions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155) on IBM Cloud&reg; for more information.\n"
msgstr "Semak peranan yang tersedia dan tindakan yang dipetakan kepada setiap satu untuk membantu anda menetapkan akses. Lihat [Peranan dan tindakan IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155) pada IBM Cloud&reg; untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service {#ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan IBM Quantum Compute {#ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
